6 0 obj
<< /Length 3239 >>
stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 738.0 Td (change record. A change may not proceed to implementation until all required approvals are recorded.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 712.0 Td (5. Pre-Deployment Testing and Validation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 689.0 Td (All changes must undergo appropriate pre-deployment testing and validation before promotion to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 675.0 Td (production. Change owners are required to perform testing in a non-production staging environment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 661.0 Td (that mirrors production as closely as practical. QA activities must include functional verification,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 647.0 Td (integration testing where applicable, and validation that the change meets its stated objective.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 633.0 Td (Evidence of successful testing and validation must be attached to the change record. Changes lacking) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 619.0 Td (documented test and verification results will not receive CAB approval.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 593.0 Td (6. Rollback and Back-Out Procedures) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 570.0 Td (Every change record must include a documented rollback plan describing how to revert or back out the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 556.0 Td (change if implementation fails or produces unintended results. The back-out procedure must be tested) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 542.0 Td (where feasible and must define the steps, resources, and time required to restore the affected) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 528.0 Td (systems to their prior known-good state. If a deployment cannot be verified as successful, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 514.0 Td (implementer must execute the rollback and undo the change, then update the record accordingly.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 488.0 Td (7. Change Audit Trail, Logging, and Documentation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 465.0 Td (ServiceNow maintains a complete change audit trail for every change throughout its lifecycle.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 451.0 Td (Records must document the requester, categorization, risk assessment, approvals, testing evidence,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 437.0 Td (implementation and verification results, and rollback outcomes. All logging, approvals, and status) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 423.0 Td (transitions are retained to support compliance, internal audit, and post-implementation review.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 409.0 Td (Change documentation and audit records are retained in accordance with HPE records retention) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 395.0 Td (requirements and must be available for inspection by auditors and regulators.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 369.0 Td (8. Roles, Compliance, and Enforcement) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 346.0 Td (Change owners, implementers, approvers, and CAB members are accountable for adhering to this policy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 332.0 Td (Compliance is monitored through periodic audits of ServiceNow change records. Deviations,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 318.0 Td (unauthorized changes, or failures to maintain the required audit trail are reported to management) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 304.0 Td (and may result in corrective action. This policy is reviewed at least annually and updated to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 290.0 Td (reflect changes in HPE's environment, regulatory obligations, and operational practices.) Tj ET
endstream
